{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15242090","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15242090","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1524209001:0":{"text":"... Get lost, you nasty beast! Take one more step and I'll—*Cough*...","source_cn":"……滚吧，该死的野兽！再敢靠近一步，我就——咳咳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x503E663F57AC0DE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1524209002:0":{"text":"The warrior before you attempts to drive away a beast with an intimidating stance. However, her pale face and the strain in her expression tell you she is barely holding on.","source_cn":"眼前的战士愤怒地驱赶着野兽，仿佛还拥有着无穷无尽的力量...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFEF098382F7F5F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1524209003:0":{"text":"You notice Kal wince in pain from time to time as she runs. Her old injuries must be acting up again.","source_cn":"在驱逐野兽的过程中，你就注意到，嘉在奔跑时偶尔会露出痛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DA1699309AB7F28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1524209004:1":{"text":"M-Mama...","source_cn":"阿，阿娘……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA86CD050BDB065F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1524209005:1":{"text":"What were you thinking? How many times have I told you it's dangerous out here? You shouldn't have come here alone!","source_cn":"你到底在想什么！我和你说过多少次了，野外不安全，不要随...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA61D7C4778CC0E1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1524209006:0":{"text":"You aren't a little girl anymore! Start thinking before you act. If we'd come any later, that beast would have ripped you apart!","source_cn":"你已经不是小孩子了，到底什么时候才能懂事？！要是我们再...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4607E2F34710CB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1524209007:0":{"text":"W-Why are you being so mean? I ran off because you yelled at me!","source_cn":"你……你干什么这么凶！我跑出来，还不是因为你那么骂我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBD06D44C8D4F7AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1524209008:0":{"text":"I just wanted to learn magic! I didn't do anything wrong!","source_cn":"我只是想要学魔法，又不是干了什么错事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x577C4B87D1FDF0A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1524209009:1":{"text":"You lied to Papa just to sneak off to class. How's that not wrong?","source_cn":"为了跑出去上课，向你阿爹撒谎，不算错事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B9086838C478E95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"